
/* TODOS
	> ISEARCH
	> ctrl+up   - navigates to the next empty line - aka backward paragraph
	> ctrl+down - navigates to the next empty line - aka forward  paragraph

	commands that are done with AI and needs checking once have the time
	> the entire common_commands.py is done with AI
